          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"pricing.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Pricing — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#0b0b0b;--card:#0f0f0f;--muted:#9aa3aa;--accent:#ffb86b;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--max:1100px}\\n    html,body{height:100%}body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,\\\"Helvetica Neue\\\",Arial;color:#eef2f3;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#050505 0%,#0b0b0b 100%);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:40px auto;padding:36px;color:#eef2f3}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:28px}\\n    .brand{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.6px}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-size:14px}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:start;margin-bottom:28px}\\n    .hero h1{font-size:36px;line-height:1.03;margin:0 0 12px;color:#fff}\\n    .hero p{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}\\n    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:22px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6)}\\n    .tiers{display:flex;gap:18px}\\n    .tier{flex:1;padding:18px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .tier h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px}\\n    .price{font-size:28px;color:var(--accent);margin:6px 0}\\n    ul{margin:10px 0 0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:14px;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--accent);color:#081018;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    footer{margin-top:36px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    /* ripple snippets */\\n    .snippet{margin-top:20px;padding:14px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--glass);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .faq dt{font-weight:700;margin-top:12px}\\n    .faq dd{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;margin-bottom:18px}.tiers{flex-direction:column}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}} <span style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-weight:400\\\">— {{TAGLINE}}</span></div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Programs</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Pricing</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>Invest in Lasting Habits — Pricing Built for Momentum</h1>\\n        <p>Transparent tiers designed around measurable habit change, not hours. Choose the pathway that matches your goals and the pace you want to sustain.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"tiers\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"tier\\\">\\n              <h3>Starter Habit Plan</h3>\\n              <div class=\\\"price\\\">$299 / month</div>\\n              <ul>\\n                <li>4 coaching sessions / month</li>\\n                <li>Weekly habit tracking template</li>\\n                <li>Email check-ins</li>\\n              </ul>\\n              <div class=\\\"note\\\">Best for people beginning a consistent routine.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"tier\\\">\\n              <h3>Momentum Coaching</h3>\\n              <div class=\\\"price\\\">$599 / month</div>\\n              <ul>\\n                <li>8 sessions / month + two deep-planning labs</li>\\n                <li>Custom habit framework & relapse plan</li>\\n                <li>Priority messaging</li>\\n              </ul>\\n              <div class=\\\"note\\\">Ideal to accelerate behavior patterns over 3–6 months.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"tier\\\">\\n              <h3>Transformative Framework</h3>\\n              <div class=\\\"price\\\">$1,200 / month</div>\\n              <ul>\\n                <li>Unlimited weekly touchpoints</li>\\n                <li>Team/partner integrations & workshops\\n                </li>\\n                <li>Quarterly outcome analysis</li>\\n              </ul>\\n              <div class=\\\"note\\\">For professionals seeking systemic change.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n          <img src=\\\"assets/img/hero.svg\\\" alt=\\\"graphic\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin-bottom:12px;border-radius:6px\\\">\\n          <strong>How pricing maps to results</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 0\\\">Plans focus on frequency, structured experiments, and measurement windows. You'll get templates and milestones so progress is visible.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"snippet\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Common Misstep vs. Evidence</h2>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Myth: More sessions = faster results. Truth: Targeted frameworks and practice frequency drive retention. Pricing is framed around practice-enabled outcomes rather than session count alone.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\" class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 10px\\\">Four Commitment Pillars</h2>\\n      <ol style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 0 18px;padding:0\\\">\\n        <li>Micro-practice design — reduce friction for new routines</li>\\n        <li>Environment shaping — optimize cues and triggers</li>\\n        <li>Measurement windows — 14/30/90 day check-ins</li>\\n        <li>Accountability architecture — roles, reminders, rewards</li>\\n      </ol>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 10px\\\">Pricing that Delivered Results</h2>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 10px\\\">A snapshot of what clients achieved with each tier (anonymized):</p>\\n        <ul style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n          <li>Starter: 63% increase in consistent 3-week streaks</li>\\n          <li>Momentum: average 45-minute weekly habit practice established</li>\\n          <li>Transformative: organizational teams reported sustained policy-free routines for 6+ months</li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\" class=\\\"panel faq\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 10px\\\">Questions About Commitment & Cost</h2>\\n      <dl>\\n        <dt>Can I switch tiers mid-plan?</dt>\\n        <dd>Yes. Plans are designed to scale with your progress — upgrades prorated within the billing cycle.</dd>\\n        <dt>Is there a money-back guarantee?</dt>\\n        <dd>We offer a 14-day satisfaction review for new clients to adjust scope or request a partial refund according to terms.</dd>\\n        <dt>Do you accept insurance?</dt>\\n        <dd>Coaching is a private, non-medical service. Receipts can be provided for client records.</dd>\\n      </dl>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:24px;text-align:center\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Book a pricing clarity call</a>\\n      <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px\\\">Prefer to talk? Call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"testimonials.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Client Stories — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fcfcfb;--ink:#071013;--muted:#64707a;--accent:#2aa6a3;--card:#ffffff;--max:1100px}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg)}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:36px auto;padding:28px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:26px}\\n    .logo{font-weight:700}\\n    nav a{margin-left:16px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}\\n    .hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff 0%,#f6f7f8 100%);padding:24px;border-left:6px solid var(--accent);border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:20px}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:28px}\\n    .hero p{color:var(--muted);margin:10px 0 0}\\n    .stories{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(10,14,16,0.06)}\\n    .quote{font-style:italic;color:#1f2b2b}\\n    .meta{margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--accent);color:white;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}\\n    .case-study{margin-top:18px}\\n    .pillars{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:14px}\\n    .pill{background:#eef8f8;padding:10px;border-radius:999px;color:#0b3f3e;font-weight:700;font-size:13px}\\n    .faq{margin-top:18px;padding:14px;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    footer{margin-top:26px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    @media(max-width:820px){.stories{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pillars{flex-wrap:wrap}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}} <span style=\\\"font-weight:400;color:var(--muted)\\\">— Evidence-based coaching</span></div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Who I Am</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Work With Me</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <h1>Real Habit Changes, Measured Progress</h1>\\n      <p>Stories from people who restructured their days using simple, repeatable practices. Each story focuses on behavior, not quick fixes.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section>\\n      <div class=\\\"pillars\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Micro-practices</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Cue design</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Accountability loops</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Data windows</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"stories\\\">\\n      <article class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"quote\\\">\\\"In eight weeks I replaced evening doom-scrolling with a 12-minute wind-down that actually helps me sleep.\\\"</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">— A professional, improved sleep consistency by 74% in 9 weeks</div>\\n      </article>\\n\\n      <article class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"quote\\\">\\\"We designed micro-checkpoints across my workday; the result was a sustained 30% increase in focused work blocks.\\\"</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">— Team lead, regained control of calendar and focus</div>\\n      </article>\\n\\n      <article class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"quote\\\">\\\"Small, repeatable systems helped me to cook weekly meals instead of ordering out. It changed my evenings and my energy.\\\"</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">— Parent, established reliable meal rhythm</div>\\n      </article>\\n\\n      <article class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"quote\\\">\\\"The relapse plan made setbacks feel informational rather than catastrophic. I stuck with it.\\\"</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">— Graduate student, maintained practice across semesters</div>\\n      </article>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"case-study\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 10px\\\">Client Deep-Dive: From Fragmented Routines to 90-Day Habit Windows</h2>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 10px\\\">Process: audit → micro-experiment → reinforcement plan → measurement window. Outcome: doubled consistent practice days and a self-reported increase in perceived agency.</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Start your own case study</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Curious? Answers from the field</h3>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Q: How long before I see habit-level shifts? A: We structure expectations in 14/30/90 day windows; small reliable gains often appear within two weeks.</p>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Q: Do you work with groups? A: Yes — there are tailored pathways for duos and small teams, with workshop modules.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px;text-align:center\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Schedule a momentum session</a>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} | {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"book.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Book a Session — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#ffffff;--ink:#0b1a1a;--muted:#6b7678;--accent:#6c5ce7;--card:#fbfbff;--max:980px}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,\\\"Helvetica Neue\\\",Arial;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg)}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:40px auto;padding:28px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:22px}\\n    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:22px}\\n    .panel{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(12,18,26,0.04)}\\n    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px}\\n    label{display:block;margin-top:10px;font-weight:700}\\n    input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;margin-top:6px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e9ee}\\n    .submit{margin-top:12px;background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:9px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block}\\n    .mini{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .myth{margin-top:16px;padding:12px;background:#f5f7ff;border-left:4px solid var(--accent);border-radius:6px}\\n    .pillars{margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px}\\n    .pill{background:#f1efff;padding:8px;border-radius:999px;color:#2a1b8f;font-weight:700;font-size:13px}\\n    .faq{margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    footer{margin-top:22px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}} <span style=\\\"font-weight:400;color:var(--muted)\\\">• Book</span></div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Services</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Stories</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <main>\\n        <div class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n          <h1>Schedule Your First Habit Reset Session</h1>\\n          <p class=\\\"mini\\\">A focused 60-minute session to set an evidence-informed 30-day practice window. Includes follow-up resources and a planning template.</p>\\n\\n          <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <label for=\\\"name\\\">Full name</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" required>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"goal\\\">Primary outcome you want</label>\\n            <select id=\\\"goal\\\" name=\\\"goal\\\">\\n              <option>Sleep consistency</option>\\n              <option>Daily movement</option>\\n              <option>Stress management</option>\\n              <option>Time and focus</option>\\n              <option>Other</option>\\n            </select>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"notes\\\">A short note about your current routine</label>\\n            <textarea id=\\\"notes\\\" name=\\\"notes\\\" rows=\\\"4\\\" placeholder=\\\"What have you tried? What works sometimes?\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"submit\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n              <div class=\\\"mini\\\">Or call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </form>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"myth\\\">\\n            <strong>Myth vs Method</strong>\\n            <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Myth: You need willpower to start. Method: Design practice cues and tiny habits so action becomes automatic over repeated contexts.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"panel\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Small Wins — Big Shifts</h2>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Typical session outcomes: clarified a single target behavior, designed a 14-day micro-experiment, and created a relapse-safe return plan.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </main>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n          <img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"avatar\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n          <strong>{{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0\\\">I pair quantified practice windows with simple environment edits. Expect evidence-first guidance and humane accountability.</p>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"pillars\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"pill\\\">14-day labs</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Relapse playbook</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Measurement kit</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n            <strong>Booking & Prep</strong>\\n            <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0 0\\\">Bring one specific behavior you want to test. We’ll outline a protocol and simple metrics during the session.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"panel\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Need a tailored package?</h3>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> for multi-session packages or group workshops.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">{{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"privacy.html\\\">Privacy</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
        }
